              {
                "dsDescriptionValue": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "Six datasets that have been used to evaluate reasoning with a Controlled Natural Language. A seventh file contains the grammar specification of the Controlled Natural Language.\n\n* 'BNF Grammar.pdf' contains the grammar specification of the Controlled Natural Language in Backus-Naur Form.\n* 'syllogism_dataset.csv' contains the adapted Kaggle dataset.\n* 'puzzles_dataset.csv' contains logical puzzles found on the internet and reformulated in the Controlled Natural Language if necessary.\n* 'gpt_dataset_easy.csv', 'gpt_dataset_hard.csv' and 'deepseek_dataset.csv' contain reasoning examples generated by Large Language Models.\n* 'interface_examples.csv' contains the inference example used in the user tests."
                },
